      "reasons": [],
      "is_risk": false,
      "conviction": null,
      "raw_mention": "LAC",
      "text": "Here is how much money you would have today if you invested $1,000 in every single stock Trump mentioned or his administration put money into since January 20, 2025.\n\nNot the cherry-picked winners. All of them. Exact closing prices the day he mentioned them or the day the government stepped in.\n\nI went through every ethics disclosure, speech transcript, TV clip, and Truth Social post to build this list.\n\nJuly 23, 2025 AI Action Plan cluster (his personal accounts bought big):\n\nNVDA: $170.78 → $1,140.82 (+14.1%)\nAAPL: $214.15 → $1,441.19 (+44.1%)\nMSFT: $505.87 → $771.92 (-22.8%)\nAMZN: $228.29 → $1,062.99 (+6.3%)\nAVGO: $283.69 → $1,270.58 (+27.1%)\nMETA: $713.58 → $816.87 (-18.3%)\n\nBig personal buys + public shoutouts:\n\nDELL: $126.01, plus the May 8 speech telling people “Go out and buy Dell!” → $3,129.28 (+212.9%)\nPLTR: $139.51, plus Truth Social praise → $926.82 (-7.3%)\n\nJune 2026 Pennsylvania speech mentions:\n\nNOK: $13.81 → $874.00 (-12.6%)\nLLY: $1,117.26 → $1,086.51 (+8.7%)\n\nMarch 2026 TV and speech mentions:\n\nMU: $355.46, called “one of the hottest companies” on Fox → $2,744.50 (+174.5%)\nTMO: $495.72, called a “great company” → $1,055.92 (+5.6%)\n\nAdministration investments (government money):\n\nINTC: $20.00 from the date his administration bought the 9.9% government stake → $6,017.49 (+501.7%)\nMP: $20.87, personal buys plus the DoD ~15% stake → $2,554.50 (+155.5%)\nLAC: $6.01, admin equity stake plus $2.3B support → $625.62 (-37.4%)\n\nThe grand total.\n\n$15,000 invested → $25,519 today.\n\n+70.1% overall.\n\nThe S&P 500 returned 21% over the same period.\n\nTrump’s picks more than tripled the market.\n\nThe monsters were DELL, MU, INTC, and MP. The critical minerals and domestic manufacturing names crushed it the moment government money stepped in, especially INTC once the administration took its stake. The mega cap tech names dragged the total down.\n\nThe pattern is crystal clear. AI infrastructure, semiconductors, rare earths, lithium, defense, and anything tied to US supply chains.\n\nNew disclosures drop, the list updates. We are tracking all of it.\n\nFollow us with notifications, this is very important.\n\nA lot of people are going to wish they followed us sooner.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DJTRadar/status/2073410686894366901",
      "kind": "post",
      "engagement": {
